  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2102.25 Visible emission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2102.25 “Visible emission” means any emission that is visually detectable without the aid of instruments, coming from asbestos waste. The term does not include condensed, uncombined water vapor.\n\nSource. #12605, eff 9-1-18 (formerly Env-Sw 2102.13)",
